{"seq":12,"slug":"multi-tenancy-patterns","title":"多租户架构模式","stage":"DONE","category":"backend-engineering","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/multi-tenancy-patterns","rating":{"composite":4.08,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.2,"coverage":3.75,"positioning":4,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"多租户架构模式-multi-tenancy-patterns\">多租户架构模式（Multi-Tenancy Patterns）</h1><p>多租户架构是 SaaS 产品的核心支柱——在同一套代码和基础设施上安全、高效地为成百上千个客户组织提供服务。这一架构决策影响深远：它直接决定了系统的安全隔离等级、运维复杂度、成本结构，以及未来能承载的租户规模上限。</p>\n<p>本 hub 围绕「如何从零设计并落地一个生产级多租户系统」展开，覆盖从租户识别到数据隔离、从平台工程到跨区域部署的完整技术栈。读者完成本 hub 后，应能独立为一个中型 SaaS 产品做出多租户架构选型并推进落地。</p>\n<p>与兄弟 hub 的分工边界：分布式事务与一致性（08）关注跨服务数据一致性的通用模式；弹性工程（09）处理故障恢复与容错；API 网关模式（10）聚焦入口层路由与聚合。本 hub 专注于「租户」这一维度如何贯穿后端系统的每一层——从请求入口的租户识别，到数据库的隔离策略，再到运行时的资源配额与可观测性。</p>\n<p>推荐学习路径：先从第一章「基础与隔离模型」建立全局认知，再进入第二章「数据层多租户」掌握三种经典隔离方案的工程实现，然后学习第三章「平台工程」理解租户生命周期与资源公平性，最后通过第四章「进阶模式」应对多区域部署、租户定制化等高级场景。</p>\n<p>前置知识：关系型数据库基础（SQL、索引、事务）、Web 服务开发经验（HTTP、中间件、ORM）、容器与编排基础概念（Docker、Kubernetes）。具备微服务架构实践经验者可直接跳入第二章。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"多租户基础与隔离模型","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/multi-tenancy-patterns/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"multi-tenancy-overview","title":"多租户架构全景概览","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/multi-tenancy-patterns/foundations/multi-tenancy-overview"},{"seq":2,"slug":"isolation-models-comparison","title":"隔离模型对比分析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/multi-tenancy-patterns/foundations/isolation-models-comparison"},{"seq":3,"slug":"tenant-identification-routing","title":"租户识别与路由机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/multi-tenancy-patterns/foundations/tenant-identification-routing"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"data-layer","title":"数据层多租户","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/multi-tenancy-patterns/data-layer","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"database-per-tenant","title":"独立数据库模式（Database-per-Tenant）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/multi-tenancy-patterns/data-layer/database-per-tenant"},{"seq":2,"slug":"schema-per-tenant","title":"独立 Schema 模式（Schema-per-Tenant）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/multi-tenancy-patterns/data-layer/schema-per-tenant"},{"seq":3,"slug":"row-level-security","title":"行级安全隔离（Row-Level Security）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/multi-tenancy-patterns/data-layer/row-level-security"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"platform-engineering","title":"平台工程","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/multi-tenancy-patterns/platform-engineering","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"tenant-lifecycle-management","title":"租户生命周期管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/multi-tenancy-patterns/platform-engineering/tenant-lifecycle-management"},{"seq":2,"slug":"resource-quota-fairness","title":"资源配额与公平性保障","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/multi-tenancy-patterns/platform-engineering/resource-quota-fairness"},{"seq":3,"slug":"tenant-aware-observability","title":"租户感知可观测性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/multi-tenancy-patterns/platform-engineering/tenant-aware-observability"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"advanced-patterns","title":"进阶模式","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/multi-tenancy-patterns/advanced-patterns","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"multi-region-tenancy","title":"多区域租户架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/multi-tenancy-patterns/advanced-patterns/multi-region-tenancy"},{"seq":2,"slug":"tenant-customization-extensibility","title":"租户定制化与可扩展性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/multi-tenancy-patterns/advanced-patterns/tenant-customization-extensibility"},{"seq":3,"slug":"migration-consolidation","title":"迁移与整合策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/multi-tenancy-patterns/advanced-patterns/migration-consolidation"}]}]}